@startuml
title Operations Log - BIAN Control Record UML
' Machine-readable reconstruction of the raster BIAN Control Record diagram
' Service Domain: Operations Log
' Source image: operations-log-bom-uml.png
' BIAN source: https://bian.org/servicelandscape-14-0-0/views/view_51978.html
' Extraction: raster reconstruction; labels normalized where legible
hide methods
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
left to right direction

class "Operations Log" as SD <<ServiceDomain>>
class "Partner Event Log" as CRT <<ControlRecord>>
class "Log" as GA <<GenericArtifact>>
class "Event" as BQT <<BehaviorQualifierType>>

class "CR Partner Event Log Instance Record" as CRI <<ControlRecordInstance>> {
  + Partner Event Log Update Log : Log
  + Partner Event Log Date and Time : DateTime
  + Partner Event Log Event Description : Text
  + Partner Event Log Reference : Identifier
  + Partner Event Log Partner Profile : Profile
  + Partner Event Log Parameter Type : Type
  + Partner Event Log Type : Text
  + Partner Event Log Related Object : Identifier
  + Partner Event Log Schedule : Schedule
  + Partner Event Log Usage Log : Log
  + Partner Event Log Associated Party : Identifier
  + Partner Event Log Business Unit Reference : Identifier
  + Partner Event Log Product Type : ProductType
  + Partner Event Log Location : Location
}

SD "1" --> "1" CRT : defines control record
CRT "1" --> "0..*" CRI : instantiated as
CRT --> GA : conforms to generic artifact
GA --> BQT : qualified by

note right of CRI
  Source was a low-resolution PNG-only BIAN diagram.
  Text has been normalized for machine-readable context.
end note

@enduml
